### Wallet API - exemplos de requisição (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
### Requer o ambiente no ar: docker compose up --build -d
@host = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = local-dev-key
@walletId = 1000

### Health (público)
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Criar carteira
POST {{host}}/api/v1/wallets
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "holderName": "Ana Souza",
  "holderDocument": "12345678900"
}

### Consultar saldo
GET {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/{{walletId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Crédito
POST {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/{{walletId}}/transactions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pix-2026-01-02-0001

{
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 150.75,
  "description": "Pix recebido"
}

### Repetir a mesma requisição (deve retornar 200 + Idempotent-Replayed: true)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/{{walletId}}/transactions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pix-2026-01-02-0001

{
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 150.75,
  "description": "Pix recebido"
}

### Mesma chave, valor diferente (deve retornar 409)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/{{walletId}}/transactions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pix-2026-01-02-0001

{
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 151.75,
  "description": "Pix recebido"
}

### Débito válido
POST {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/{{walletId}}/transactions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: ted-2026-01-02-0001

{
  "type": "DEBIT",
  "amount": 50.25,
  "description": "Ted enviada"
}

### Débito sem saldo (deve retornar 422)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/{{walletId}}/transactions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: ted-2026-01-02-0002

{
  "type": "DEBIT",
  "amount": 999999.00,
  "description": "Ted acima do saldo"
}

### Extrato paginado
GET {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/{{walletId}}/transactions?page=0&size=20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Extrato filtrado por período e tipo
GET {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/{{walletId}}/transactions?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-02-01T00:00:00Z&type=CREDIT
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Sem API key (deve retornar 401)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/{{walletId}}

### Carteira inexistente (deve retornar 404)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/wallets/999999999
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
